# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# The first 6 bytes of a header only (the unit id byte is missing).
# Framed, the framer waits: decode returns Ok(None) and the buffer is untouched. Read as one whole header, MbapHeader::decode reports Truncated.
00 01 00 00 00 06
